OL,4,BBancroft sandpaper claims heap         
OL,5,Bpressure on Cummins                    
OL,6,GCameron Bancroft has claimed the whole 
OL,7,GAustralia team knew about the 2018     
OL,8,Gsandpaper plot in explosive            
OL,9,Grevelations that will heap pressure on 
OL,10,Gcurrent captain Pat Cummins.           
OL,12,FIn a detailed testimony, published by  
OL,13,Fthe West Australian, batter Bancroft - 
OL,14,Fthe player caught with the sandpaper   
OL,15,Fduring the Test match against South    
OL,16,FAfrica - has given arguably the most   
OL,17,Fcomplete account of the events in Cape 
OL,18,FTown eight years ago.                  
